{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c656b6e6217131e3e343a55b6951a6b1975c7b00b6299d46d3be2c85b70827b5", "ja": "おっ、ロコ、衣装のフィッティング中か。\nよく似合ってるじゃないか！", "zh": "哦，ROCO，正在试穿演出服啊。\n这身很适合你嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "4735216e3417ce40ef93d1e9aa9faad4c45620809ae62e4637812bc3f58f05ae", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nこの衣装は、まさしくロコアートそのものです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！这套服装简直就是ROCO艺术本身！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d816a486c521734aeb8da59817126f0530f83c8dac305430915c11e28c28d79d", "ja": "ブログでも、ファンのみんなから\n好評のコメントがいっぱい届いてたぞ。", "zh": "博客上也收到了粉丝们好多好评呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "4ccd5fa3bdcadd4a6092c196b0f307f7133d55e91c1c276fbe02ac5af7e6fd60", "ja": "えへへ。オフの日、一日中かけて、\nデザインをブラッシュアップした甲斐がありました。", "zh": "嘻嘻。休息日花了一整天把设计打磨得更好，果然没白费。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "1b826831d55c5cae465830ce2d6e7a61fc4aa3f16fff4e2726c86f0749dcbfd7", "ja": "{$P$}、ベリーサンクスです！\nこんな衣装を貰えて、とってもハッピーです♪", "zh": "{$P$}，超级感谢！能拿到这样的服装，我特别开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f9aa7cf82770024fa09ab06bda9261e8a0ccf0bb5ba11a79da941afbb594b385", "ja": "いや、俺は大したことはしてないよ。\nデザインは、ロコと青羽さんがしてくれたわけだし。", "zh": "不，我也没做什么了不起的事。\n设计是由ROCO和青羽小姐负责的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "0f275f259e359092219c6709bb3de38a05c32b867161b64c53c4f19e38a6cd9f", "ja": "でも、ロコのソングとデザインのマッチングを\nサジェストしてくれましたよね？", "zh": "不过，您不是还建议了ROCO的歌曲和设计如何搭配吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1007_p", "source_sha256": "879039053c2753a4efb6bc2b2d23296b29b410ec2001fd795c27946f52583135", "ja": "ああ、そういうコンセプトは、\n確かに提示したけど……でも、それだけだし。", "zh": "啊，那个概念确实是我提出来的……不过，也就只有这个而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "3462021dae76fe3e92a092c4ad4f7060b8f71a2fd2769425ee0b89bf29a173b7", "ja": "そんなことないです！　ロコはソングとの\nマッチングは、あまり意識してはいませんでした。", "zh": "才不是那样！我当时并没有特别考虑ROCO和歌曲的搭配。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "1dfc92833a12df31a310f4045198c826d1afc402fd6e5dddf36aee0c7595e1ad", "ja": "だけど実際に着てみたら、どんなパフォーマンスを\nしたいのか、イメージがどんどん湧いてきて……。", "zh": "但是实际穿上后，我渐渐涌现出了想要呈现怎样的表演的想法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "8ca56fe375e2fb73b1a49960006777c6f91dec50f805749602cd063c69ff1a05", "ja": "もしかしたらこのマッチングを通して、\nアイドルのロコ自身が、新しいアートになれるかも！", "zh": "说不定通过这次匹配，偶像的ROCO本身，也能成为全新的艺术呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1011_p", "source_sha256": "331518f46c6800bd37c0efccbdd1e6f41c500040fc9d62a25d7a944f709a7895", "ja": "ロコ自身がアートに……うん、いいな！\nそれはかなり、アイドルらしい考え方かもしれない！", "zh": "ROCO自己成为艺术……嗯，不错！\n这想法还真是很有偶像风格！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1012_p", "source_sha256": "aed0dce541639cc4df52f96e7c85ad8ca52fefddd376054a4d35079fbf19093e", "ja": "そうだ。今度機会があれば、劇場のみんなの\n衣装デザインもロコに考えてもらおうかな。どうだ？", "zh": "对了，下次有机会的话，剧场大家的\n服装设计也让ROCO来负责，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "e5a12213812af4065d5514a7f91d87486891efc3a4466a56c05c7f9f7ed8d5bc", "ja": "劇場のみんな、って……全員分ですか！？\nそれは……アメイジングなプランですね！", "zh": "剧场的大家……是说全员吗！？  \n那真是……绝妙的计划呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "4e5f798d27e56230f5dd6d75fe09b80d5522737d61695ffad6b34831fc6b8103", "ja": "たとえばアユムにはソーダファウンテン、モモコは\nビタースイートなフロートのイメージとか……。", "zh": "比如说，步是苏打喷泉，桃子则是苦甜风味的漂浮冰淇淋之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "a12b8a979b8d5a6e63328514878ef67b963a6d1e8d715068281f66824f5c6b69", "ja": "それからゴシックテーマでも、アンナにはビビッドな\nワンポイントを加えて、ユリコはフォーマルにして。", "zh": "另外，就算是哥特主题，也要给杏奈加上亮眼的点缀，百合子则走正式风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1016_p", "source_sha256": "488116432c9119cf78f07f22cebfd08e4fa4de1cf66c0c4cca61b39013ae6e35", "ja": "おおっ！　それから？", "zh": "哦！然后呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "e29da3f33a28de17a358e74a91f7ae5dc212107b02f16668bae68df9348983e8", "ja": "それからスバルは……あっ、スバルはどうしましょう！\nキュートだけど、でもアクティブなフォームが……。", "zh": "然后昴的话……啊，昴该怎么办呢！  \n虽然很可爱，可是又有很活泼的造型……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "2d70936e322e6d4f40391d7540db7e3a22b51cf3341311a556e419b1f12ec252", "ja": "うう、アイディアが出すぎて止まりません！　一旦\nストップさせてください、{$P$}！", "zh": "呜呜，灵感冒出来太多根本停不下来！先让我\n暂停一下吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a1cfbb506fce43eabf2ffb772982f3af5235559cbfc19c3aa08ceda2f89d19f4", "ja": "止まらなくていい。アイディアはどんどん出そう。\nゆっくりで構わないから。", "zh": "不用停。尽管不断想出点子吧。\n慢慢来就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "fbd7bc9d7bb85c595c023122dcfa49a733366a7d35d91da89d78a83f8a4a69d5", "ja": "そ、そうですか……そうですね！　では、いつか\nコミットするために、いろいろ考えておきますね！", "zh": "是、是这样吗……说得对！那么，为了将来能够提交，我会先好好构思各种各样的点子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1021_025roc", "source_sha256": "b0b7b49dc737deb261c0fc2190560e43fe81a09fdba1b9c569ed40599b3d278b", "ja": "その時がきたら、衣装だけじゃなく劇場の\n隅々まで全部、ロコナイズしてみせます！", "zh": "到那时候，不只是服装，我还要把剧场的每个角落全部都ROCO化给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0244_1022_p", "source_sha256": "b321b0af15ed6d6e7f69a9b4dffbdf34cc807067757a774089cf4964e612a6a5", "ja": "（まだ見たことのない壮大なロコアート……\n本当にいつか、実現できるといいな。楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（前所未见的宏伟ROCO艺术……真希望有一天能够实现。好期待啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
